Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.51,0:00:01.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,Hey everyone!
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.54,0:00:02.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Day 1
Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.64,0:00:04.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,of building in public.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.17,0:00:04.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.43,0:00:04.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,I want to show
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.83,0:00:05.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,you something I've been
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.43,0:00:06.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,working on.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.44,0:00:07.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's an interactive Koi
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.55,0:00:09.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,Fish wallpaper.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.05,0:00:09.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,Just click anywhere on
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.93,0:00:10.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,the water to drop
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.71,0:00:11.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,some fish food,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.94,0:00:12.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,and watch the koi
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.63,0:00:13.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,swim towards it and
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.76,0:00:14.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,start eating.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.77,0:00:15.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,If the food lands
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.66,0:00:17.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,on a lotus leaf,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.01,0:00:18.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,the leaves actually move
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.88,0:00:20.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,and react to it.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.22,0:00:20.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,I've also added a
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.98,0:00:22.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,lot of little details
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.17,0:00:23.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,to make the pond
Dialogue: 2,0:00:23.05,0:00:24.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,feel alive:
Dialogue: 2,0:00:24.33,0:00:25.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,realistic water ripples,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.86,0:00:27.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,tiny air bubbles,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.24,0:00:28.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,soft shadows from the
Dialogue: 2,0:00:28.26,0:00:29.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,lotus flowers,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.36,0:00:30.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,and much more.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.52,0:00:31.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,You can customize the
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.34,0:00:32.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,experience, too.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:32.91,0:00:33.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,Change the number of
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.62,0:00:34.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,fish in the pond,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.98,0:00:35.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,adjust the frame rate
Dialogue: 2,0:00:35.85,0:00:38.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,up to 144 FPS,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.18,0:00:39.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,and choose the rendering
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.10,0:00:39.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,quality,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.82,0:00:40.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,from low all the
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.56,0:00:41.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,way up to Ultra.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.94,0:00:42.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,But this is just
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.62,0:00:43.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,the beginning.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.82,0:00:44.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of adding
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.78,0:00:46.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,a day-and-night cycle,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.15,0:00:47.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,so you can experience
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.01,0:00:48.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,the pond under moonlight,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.68,0:00:49.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,along with a rainy
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.54,0:00:50.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,weather effect,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.53,0:00:51.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,where raindrops create
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.78,0:00:53.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,ripples across the water.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:53.66,0:00:55.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,And one more thing.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.54,0:00:56.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm also looking for
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.29,0:00:57.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,someone with a similar
Dialogue: 2,0:00:57.14,0:00:58.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,mindset,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:58.05,0:00:59.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,who enjoys building products
Dialogue: 2,0:00:59.75,0:01:00.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,and experimenting with
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.68,0:01:01.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,ideas.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.74,0:01:02.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,I've worked on Android
Dialogue: 2,0:01:02.44,0:01:04.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,development, and
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.05,0:01:06.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'd love to collaborate,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.18,0:01:06.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,build,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.85,0:01:07.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,launch,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.69,0:01:08.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,and potentially sell products
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.85,0:01:09.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,together.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:09.76,0:01:10.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,I think building together
Dialogue: 2,0:01:10.96,0:01:12.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,is more fun.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:12.20,0:01:13.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,You share ideas,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.67,0:01:14.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,learn from each other,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:14.90,0:01:16.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,and create better things.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:16.60,0:01:17.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,If that sounds interesting,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:17.89,0:01:19.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,feel free to DM me.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:19.53,0:01:20.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,Let's build something
Dialogue: 2,0:01:20.21,0:01:20.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,together!
